{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"publication\": {\n    \"ref\": \"https://doi.org/10.1101/2023.02.27.529710\",\n    \"title\": \"The effect of deep brain stimulation on cortico-subcortical networks in Parkinson’s disease patients with freezing of gait: Exhaustive exploration of a basic model\",\n    \"publication_status\": \"preprint\",\n    \"version_of_candidate\": null,\n    \"study_id_candidate\": \"bioRxiv:2023.02.27.529710\",\n    \"cohort_id_candidate\": \"not_applicable_no_human_cohort\",\n    \"cohort_relation_basis\": \"本文为计算神经网络建模研究，不包含新招募的人体或动物队列。研究构建12节点的FoG相关皮层-皮质下有向带符号网络，采用确定性SER模型进行模拟。因此不存在可识别的患者队列或队列重叠关系。\",\n    \"source_type\": \"primary\",\n    \"basis\": \"fulltext\",\n    \"fulltext_checked\": true\n  },\n  \"evidence\": [\n    {\n      \"eid_local\": \"POP2023_E01\",\n      \"design\": \"原始计算建模研究；使用有向带符号神经网络及确定性susceptible-excited-refractory（SER）模型，比较healthy与PD网络拓扑。\",\n      \"population\": \"无人体或动物受试者。模型包括12个脑区节点：LC、PRF、CNF、PPN、SNr、STN、GPi、GPe、Str、Ctx、SNc和Th。\",\n      \"n_enrolled\": null,\n      \"n_analyzed\": null,\n      \"n_patients_with_FOG\": null,\n      \"n_patients_with_valid_neural_data\": null,\n      \"n_FOG_events\": null,\n      \"n_trials\": null,\n      \"n_electrodes_contacts\": null,\n      \"missing_reason\": \"不适用：纯计算建模研究，无患者招募、神经记录或真实FOG事件。模型包含12个网络节点；全部初始状态数为3^12=531441，但不能将其作为患者数、FOG事件数或临床试次数。\",\n      \"endpoint_class\": \"unclear\",\n      \"event_phase\": \"not_applicable\",\n      \"freezing_phenotype\": \"全文未报告具体FOG表现类型；没有区分akinetic、trembling-in-place或其他表型。\",\n      \"medication_phenotype\": \"unknown\",\n      \"experimental_medication_state\": \"不适用；未进行药物状态操纵，也未报告患者Med-On或Med-Off状态。\",\n      \"DBS_state_and_parameters\": \"本项比较healthy与PD网络拓扑，不涉及实际电刺激。PD网络通过将SNc发出的所有连接权重设置为0构建。无刺激频率、幅度、脉宽或触点信息。\",\n      \"task\": \"无实际步行、转弯、启动或双任务；分析网络拓扑。\",\n      \"recording_location\": \"无患者神经记录。STN仅作为网络中的一个解剖节点，而非实际电生理记录部位。\",\n      \"measure\": \"节点级betweenness centrality（中介中心性）。\",\n      \"frequency_and_analysis_window\": \"不涉及神经振荡频段、LFP频谱或时间窗；属于网络图论分析。\",\n      \"finding\": \"与healthy网络相比，PD网络中SNc和SNr的betweenness centrality分别下降0.04和0.02；PPN和cortex分别上升0.01和0.02。作者认为PPN、cortex和SNr中介中心性的变化可能提示与FoG发作有关的脑干环路病理活动。\",\n      \"effect_estimate\": \"SNc：-0.04；SNr：-0.02；PPN：+0.01；cortex：+0.02。均为网络拓扑描述性变化，无置信区间或P值。\",\n      \"statistical_unit_and_method\": \"网络节点级描述性图论指标；比较healthy与PD两种拓扑配置。不是患者级统计，也不是神经事件级统计。未报告推断统计检验。\",\n      \"risk_of_bias\": {\n        \"tool_or_framework\": \"adapted_not_validated：计算模型研究评价框架；非RoB 2或ROBINS-I。\",\n        \"domains\": [\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"模型构念效度与生物学真实性\",\n            \"judgement\": \"high\",\n            \"reason\": \"采用简化的三状态确定性SER模型，作者明确指出该框架并非用于模拟真实神经元动力学。因此中介中心性不能直接解释为真实患者STN神经活动。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Discussion，p.12；Introduction，p.3\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"网络拓扑设定\",\n            \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\",\n            \"reason\": \"网络连接根据解剖文献及小鼠Allen脑连接图谱构建，连接权重采用二值正负值。作者明确承认初始网络拓扑会显著影响模拟动力学。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Materials and methods，pp.13-14；Discussion，p.12\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"FOG结局构念效度\",\n            \"judgement\": \"high\",\n            \"reason\": \"没有患者步行观察、视频确认的FOG或事件级行为标签。图论结果仅属于FoG相关网络的模型特征。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Abstract，p.1；Results，pp.4-6\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"参数敏感性及稳健性\",\n            \"judgement\": \"unclear\",\n            \"reason\": \"全文报告对初始状态进行穷举，但未报告不同网络连接权重或替代拓扑设定下的敏感性分析。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Materials and methods，pp.14-15\"\n          }\n        ],\n        \"overall\": \"high\"\n      },\n      \"limitations\": \"这是网络拓扑层面的间接模型证据，不是STN神经放电或STN-LFP与FOG的直接证据。中心性变化不能解释为STN beta功率、burst或神经元放电变化。PD状态本身通过SNc输出连接删除模拟。\",\n      \"quote\": \"The SNc and SNr betweenness centralities drop by 0.04 and 0.02\",\n      \"source_locator\": {\n        \"section\": \"Results: Topological properties of healthy, PD and stimulated networks\",\n        \"page\": \"5/20\",\n        \"figure_table\": \"Fig. 3A\",\n        \"supplement\": null\n      },\n      \"basis\": \"fulltext\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"eid_local\": \"POP2023_E02\",\n      \"design\": \"原始计算建模研究；确定性SER模型及网络图论分析。\",\n      \"population\": \"无患者样本；12节点FoG相关皮层-皮质下网络。\",\n      \"n_enrolled\": null,\n      \"n_analyzed\": null,\n      \"n_patients_with_FOG\": null,\n      \"n_patients_with_valid_neural_data\": null,\n      \"n_FOG_events\": null,\n      \"n_trials\": null,\n      \"n_electrodes_contacts\": null,\n      \"missing_reason\": \"不适用：计算模型，没有人体受试者或临床试次。模型穷举531441个初始状态，但这些不是临床样本分母。\",\n      \"endpoint_class\": \"unclear\",\n      \"event_phase\": \"not_applicable\",\n      \"freezing_phenotype\": \"未报告具体FOG表型。\",\n      \"medication_phenotype\": \"unknown\",\n      \"experimental_medication_state\": \"不适用；无药物状态操纵。\",\n      \"DBS_state_and_parameters\": \"healthy与PD网络拓扑比较，无实际DBS。PD网络通过SNc输出连接权重置零构建。\",\n      \"task\": \"网络图论分析，无实际运动任务。\",\n      \"recording_location\": \"无电生理记录；不涉及STN-LFP或单单位记录。\",\n      \"measure\": \"网络级同步倾向相关图论指标：mean clustering coefficient、mean betweenness centrality、maximal betweenness centrality、average shortest path length及betweenness centrality的标准差。\",\n      \"frequency_and_analysis_window\": \"不适用；无神经振荡频段或电生理分析窗口。\",\n      \"finding\": \"PD相对于healthy网络，mean clustering coefficient、mean betweenness centrality及average shortest path length下降，而maximal betweenness centrality和betweenness centrality的标准差上升。作者认为这些拓扑变化通常促进网络节点同步。\",\n      \"effect_estimate\": \"五项指标的变化方向有正文明确报告，但正文未提供所有指标的精确数值；具体图形见Fig.3B-F。没有置信区间或P值。\",\n      \"statistical_unit_and_method\": \"网络级图论描述性指标；比较两种网络拓扑。作者依据既有网络同步理论解释指标方向，没有报告患者级或试次级推断统计。\",\n      \"risk_of_bias\": {\n        \"tool_or_framework\": \"adapted_not_validated：计算模型研究评价框架。\",\n        \"domains\": [\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"模型构念效度\",\n            \"judgement\": \"high\",\n            \"reason\": \"图论指标反映模型拓扑，而非直接记录的神经元同步或患者神经振荡。作者将这些指标作为同步倾向的间接解释。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Results，pp.5-6；Materials and methods，p.14\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"网络拓扑设定\",\n            \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\",\n            \"reason\": \"拓扑由文献和连接图谱构建，且作者承认其选择会影响动力学结果。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Discussion，p.12\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"外部验证\",\n            \"judgement\": \"high\",\n            \"reason\": \"没有使用患者STN或其他脑区的同步电生理记录验证模型预测。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Results，pp.5-6；Discussion，pp.11-12\"\n          }\n        ],\n        \"overall\": \"high\"\n      },\n      \"limitations\": \"这是模型拓扑所推导的同步倾向，不是直接测量的神经同步。不同图论指标对同步的关系并非完全一致，作者在Materials and methods中也承认betweenness相关指标的解释具有复杂性。不能据此认定患者STN beta同步必然增强。\",\n      \"quote\": \"These changes, despite their intricate nature and interactions, usually promote synchronization.\",\n      \"source_locator\": {\n        \"section\": \"Results: Topological properties of healthy, PD and stimulated networks\",\n        \"page\": \"6/20\",\n        \"figure_table\": \"Fig. 3B-F\",\n        \"supplement\": null\n      },\n      \"basis\": \"fulltext\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"eid_local\": \"POP2023_E03\",\n      \"design\": \"原始计算建模研究；网络模块化分析。\",\n      \"population\": \"无患者样本；12节点FoG相关网络。\",\n      \"n_enrolled\": null,\n      \"n_analyzed\": null,\n      \"n_patients_with_FOG\": null,\n      \"n_patients_with_valid_neural_data\": null,\n      \"n_FOG_events\": null,\n      \"n_trials\": null,\n      \"n_electrodes_contacts\": null,\n      \"missing_reason\": \"不适用：无患者或临床事件；分析单位为网络拓扑。\",\n      \"endpoint_class\": \"unclear\",\n      \"event_phase\": \"not_applicable\",\n      \"freezing_phenotype\": \"未报告。\",\n      \"medication_phenotype\": \"unknown\",\n      \"experimental_medication_state\": \"不适用。\",\n      \"DBS_state_and_parameters\": \"healthy与PD网络比较；无实际刺激。\",\n      \"task\": \"无运动任务；网络社区检测。\",\n      \"recording_location\": \"无神经记录。\",\n      \"measure\": \"Modularity及Leiden社区检测得到的网络社区数量和节点归属。\",\n      \"frequency_and_analysis_window\": \"不适用；非电生理频谱分析。\",\n      \"finding\": \"PD网络较healthy网络具有更多社区。healthy配置中识别出两个主要社区，PD配置中识别出三个主要社区。作者将该变化解释为FoG网络的病理性碎片化，可能类似disconnection syndrome。\",\n      \"effect_estimate\": \"社区数量：healthy=2；PD=3。未报告置信区间或P值。\",\n      \"statistical_unit_and_method\": \"单个网络配置的社区结构比较；采用Leiden community detection method分析有向加权图。\",\n      \"risk_of_bias\": {\n        \"tool_or_framework\": \"adapted_not_validated：计算模型研究评价框架。\",\n        \"domains\": [\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"模型构念效度\",\n            \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\",\n            \"reason\": \"社区数量是网络拓扑指标，不能直接等同于患者脑功能连接断裂。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Results，p.6；Materials and methods，p.14\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"网络拓扑设定\",\n            \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\",\n            \"reason\": \"社区结果依赖所选节点、连接方向、权重和网络结构。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Materials and methods，pp.13-14\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"临床外部验证\",\n            \"judgement\": \"high\",\n            \"reason\": \"没有患者级功能连接或FOG事件数据验证社区数量变化。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Results，p.6\"\n          }\n        ],\n        \"overall\": \"high\"\n      },\n      \"limitations\": \"模块化结果来自模型网络，并非患者静息态fMRI、MEG或皮层-STN功能连接测量。不能作为直接的患者FOG网络碎片化证据。\",\n      \"quote\": \"the PD state leads to a larger number of communities in the graph\",\n      \"source_locator\": {\n        \"section\": \"Results: Topological properties of healthy, PD and stimulated networks\",\n        \"page\": \"6/20\",\n        \"figure_table\": \"Fig. 4\",\n        \"supplement\": null\n      },\n      \"basis\": \"fulltext\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"eid_local\": \"POP2023_E04\",\n      \"design\": \"原始计算建模研究；穷举确定性SER模型所有初始状态，比较healthy与PD网络的吸引子动力学。\",\n      \"population\": \"无患者样本；12节点FoG网络，每个节点具有S、E、R三种状态。\",\n      \"n_enrolled\": null,\n      \"n_analyzed\": null,\n      \"n_patients_with_FOG\": null,\n      \"n_patients_with_valid_neural_data\": null,\n      \"n_FOG_events\": null,\n      \"n_trials\": null,\n      \"n_electrodes_contacts\": null,\n      \"missing_reason\": \"不适用：模型的531441个初始状态不是患者、试次或FOG事件。\",\n      \"endpoint_class\": \"unclear\",\n      \"event_phase\": \"not_applicable\",\n      \"freezing_phenotype\": \"未模拟具体冻结事件或冻结表型。\",\n      \"medication_phenotype\": \"unknown\",\n      \"experimental_medication_state\": \"不适用。\",\n      \"DBS_state_and_parameters\": \"healthy与PD网络拓扑；PD由SNc所有输出边权设置为0模拟；无实际DBS。\",\n      \"task\": \"确定性SER网络动力学；穷举所有初始状态。\",\n      \"recording_location\": \"无神经记录；分析网络节点状态。\",\n      \"measure\": \"Network attractor landscape：fixed points、period-3 limit cycles、unique limit cycles及最大吸引盆占比。\",\n      \"frequency_and_analysis_window\": \"离散时间SER模型；模拟总时间T=100，transient time t=40；共3^12=531441种初始状态。无神经振荡频率定义。\",\n      \"finding\": \"PD网络相较healthy网络，fixed points所占比例下降，period-3 limit cycles比例上升；unique limit cycles数量增加，最大吸引盆在limit-cycle空间中的占比增大。\",\n      \"effect_estimate\": \"Healthy：fixed points=452600（85%）；period-3 limit cycles=78841（15%）；unique limit cycles=31；最大吸引盆占limit-cycle空间15%。PD：fixed points=373074（70%）；period-3 limit cycles=158367（30%）；unique limit cycles=56；最大吸引盆占35%。\",\n      \"statistical_unit_and_method\": \"网络配置级确定性模拟；遍历全部531441种初始状态，计算吸引子数量及其吸引盆。不是患者级统计；没有P值或置信区间。\",\n      \"risk_of_bias\": {\n        \"tool_or_framework\": \"adapted_not_validated：计算模型研究评价框架。\",\n        \"domains\": [\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"模型构念效度\",\n            \"judgement\": \"high\",\n            \"reason\": \"SER模型只有S、E、R三个离散状态，不能模拟真实神经元放电动力学。作者明确说明该框架不旨在生成真实神经元放电模式。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Discussion，p.12\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"网络拓扑与PD状态建模\",\n            \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\",\n            \"reason\": \"PD仅通过SNc输出连接置零模拟，不能完整表达PD病理状态。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Materials and methods，p.13\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"结局效度\",\n            \"judgement\": \"high\",\n            \"reason\": \"吸引子数量不是实际FOG发生率、持续时间或临床严重程度。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Results，pp.6-9\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"参数敏感性\",\n            \"judgement\": \"unclear\",\n            \"reason\": \"对初始状态穷举不等同于对网络参数和模型结构进行敏感性分析。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Materials and methods，p.15\"\n          }\n        ],\n        \"overall\": \"high\"\n      },\n      \"limitations\": \"模型结果表明PD拓扑改变了网络吸引子分布，但没有将任何吸引子定义为实际FOG事件。因此不能将period-3 limit cycle比例解释为患者冻结步态发生率，也不能将其视为STN beta振荡的直接证据。\",\n      \"quote\": \"Number of period-3 limit cycles 78841 (15%) 158367 (30%)\",\n      \"source_locator\": {\n        \"section\": \"Results: Emerging dynamical patterns\",\n        \"page\": \"7/20\",\n        \"figure_table\": \"Table 1\",\n        \"supplement\": null\n      },\n      \"basis\": \"fulltext\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"eid_local\": \"POP2023_E05\",\n      \"design\": \"原始计算建模研究；确定性SER模型；比较PD与STN DBS网络配置。\",\n      \"population\": \"无患者样本；12节点FoG相关网络。\",\n      \"n_enrolled\": null,\n      \"n_analyzed\": null,\n      \"n_patients_with_FOG\": null,\n      \"n_patients_with_valid_neural_data\": null,\n      \"n_FOG_events\": null,\n      \"n_trials\": null,\n      \"n_electrodes_contacts\": null,\n      \"missing_reason\": \"不适用：纯计算模型，无患者、电生理记录或临床试次。\",\n      \"endpoint_class\": \"unclear\",\n      \"event_phase\": \"not_applicable\",\n      \"freezing_phenotype\": \"未报告或模拟具体FOG表型。\",\n      \"medication_phenotype\": \"unknown\",\n      \"experimental_medication_state\": \"不适用；没有药物状态操纵。\",\n      \"DBS_state_and_parameters\": \"STN DBS通过将PD网络中所有从STN发出的连接权重设置为0模拟，依据virtual lesion hypothesis。并非实际电刺激；无频率、幅度、脉宽或电极触点参数。\",\n      \"task\": \"确定性SER模型网络动力学，无步行任务。\",\n      \"recording_location\": \"无实际神经记录；STN作为网络节点。\",\n      \"measure\": \"STN DBS条件下network attractor landscape，包括fixed points、period-3 limit cycles及unique limit cycles。\",\n      \"frequency_and_analysis_window\": \"SER离散时间模拟；T=100，transient t=40；每种网络配置穷举531441个初始状态。\",\n      \"finding\": \"相较PD配置，STN DBS配置中fixed points比例上升，period-3 limit cycles比例下降，unique limit cycles数量显著减少。最大吸引盆占limit-cycle空间的比例仅小幅下降。\",\n      \"effect_estimate\": \"PD：fixed points=373074（70%），period-3 limit cycles=158367（30%），unique limit cycles=56，最大limit cycle占35%。STN DBS：fixed points=476559（90%），period-3 limit cycles=54882（10%），unique limit cycles=8，最大limit cycle占31%。\",\n      \"statistical_unit_and_method\": \"网络配置级确定性模拟；统计全部初始状态收敛至不同吸引子的数量和比例。无患者级统计、P值或置信区间。\",\n      \"risk_of_bias\": {\n        \"tool_or_framework\": \"adapted_not_validated：计算模型研究评价框架。\",\n        \"domains\": [\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"DBS干预构念效度\",\n            \"judgement\": \"high\",\n            \"reason\": \"STN DBS被简化为删除所有STN输出连接，而非真实高频刺激的电场、轴突激活或网络调制。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Materials and methods，pp.13-14\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"模型生物学真实性\",\n            \"judgement\": \"high\",\n            \"reason\": \"确定性三状态SER模型不能代表真实STN神经元放电。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Discussion，p.12\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"临床FOG结局验证\",\n            \"judgement\": \"high\",\n            \"reason\": \"没有患者FOG事件或实际步态行为作为结局。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Results，pp.7-9\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"参数敏感性\",\n            \"judgement\": \"unclear\",\n            \"reason\": \"没有报告不同刺激参数或替代模型假设下的稳健性分析。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Materials and methods，pp.13-15\"\n          }\n        ],\n        \"overall\": \"high\"\n      },\n      \"limitations\": \"这是STN输出连接被删除后的模型结果，不能解释为实际STN刺激使神经元放电减少，也不能解释为STN DBS直接抑制了FOG。作者将该处理定义为virtual lesion。\",\n      \"quote\": \"Number of period-3 limit cycles 158367 (30%) 54882 (10%)\",\n      \"source_locator\": {\n        \"section\": \"Results: Emerging dynamical patterns\",\n        \"page\": \"7/20\",\n        \"figure_table\": \"Table 1；Fig. 6B\",\n        \"supplement\": null\n      },\n      \"basis\": \"fulltext\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"eid_local\": \"POP2023_E06\",\n      \"design\": \"原始计算建模研究；确定性SER模型；比较PD与联合STN+SNr DBS网络配置。\",\n      \"population\": \"无患者样本；12节点FoG相关网络。\",\n      \"n_enrolled\": null,\n      \"n_analyzed\": null,\n      \"n_patients_with_FOG\": null,\n      \"n_patients_with_valid_neural_data\": null,\n      \"n_FOG_events\": null,\n      \"n_trials\": null,\n      \"n_electrodes_contacts\": null,\n      \"missing_reason\": \"不适用：纯计算模型，无患者或临床FOG事件。\",\n      \"endpoint_class\": \"unclear\",\n      \"event_phase\": \"not_applicable\",\n      \"freezing_phenotype\": \"未报告或模拟具体FOG表型。\",\n      \"medication_phenotype\": \"unknown\",\n      \"experimental_medication_state\": \"不适用。\",\n      \"DBS_state_and_parameters\": \"STN+SNr联合刺激通过将PD网络中STN和SNr发出的所有连接权重设置为0模拟。属于virtual lesion模型，不是实际电刺激。未模拟刺激频率、幅度、脉宽及触点。\",\n      \"task\": \"确定性SER网络动力学，无实际运动任务。\",\n      \"recording_location\": \"无神经记录；STN和SNr均为模型网络节点。\",\n      \"measure\": \"联合STN+SNr DBS下network attractor landscape及新出现的period-3 limit cycles。\",\n      \"frequency_and_analysis_window\": \"SER离散时间模拟；T=100，transient t=40；穷举531441个初始状态。\",\n      \"finding\": \"相较PD网络，STN+SNr DBS配置中period-3 limit cycles比例增加，fixed points比例下降。该配置出现36个新的limit cycles，占STN+SNr DBS配置全部limit cycles的66%。作者指出该网络已远离PD配置中吸引盆最大的limit cycle。\",\n      \"effect_estimate\": \"PD：fixed points=373074（70%），period-3 limit cycles=158367（30%），unique limit cycles=56，最大limit cycle占35%。STN+SNr DBS：fixed points=284931（54%），period-3 limit cycles=246510（46%），unique limit cycles=53，最大limit cycle占15%。新出现的limit cycles=36，占该配置limit-cycle空间66%。\",\n      \"statistical_unit_and_method\": \"网络配置级确定性模拟；比较全部初始条件的吸引子分布及吸引盆。无患者级推断统计、P值或置信区间。\",\n      \"risk_of_bias\": {\n        \"tool_or_framework\": \"adapted_not_validated：计算模型研究评价框架。\",\n        \"domains\": [\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"DBS干预构念效度\",\n            \"judgement\": \"high\",\n            \"reason\": \"联合刺激被模拟为删除STN及SNr全部输出连接，未考虑实际刺激参数、轴突激活或刺激扩散。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Materials and methods，pp.13-14\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"模型构念效度\",\n            \"judgement\": \"high\",\n            \"reason\": \"SER模型为简化的三状态模型，不是实际神经元放电动力学模型。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Discussion，p.12\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"临床结局效度\",\n            \"judgement\": \"high\",\n            \"reason\": \"没有实际患者FOG发生、步态表现或临床改善数据。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Results，pp.8-9\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"参数敏感性与外部验证\",\n            \"judgement\": \"unclear\",\n            \"reason\": \"没有报告替代拓扑、刺激参数或患者神经记录对该吸引子结果的验证。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Discussion，pp.11-12\"\n          }\n        ],\n        \"overall\": \"high\"\n      },\n      \"limitations\": \"36个新吸引子是模型动力学状态，不是36次FOG事件或36名患者。该结果支持模型内网络状态重组假设，不能直接证明联合刺激在临床上优于单独STN DBS。\",\n      \"quote\": \"36 new limit cycles, which constitute 66% of all the limit cycles in the STN+SNr DBS attractor space.\",\n      \"source_locator\": {\n        \"section\": \"Results: Emerging dynamical patterns\",\n        \"page\": \"9/20\",\n        \"figure_table\": \"Fig. 6C；Table 1\",\n        \"supplement\": null\n      },\n      \"basis\": \"fulltext\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"eid_local\": \"POP2023_E07\",\n      \"design\": \"原始计算建模研究；确定性SER模型；分析不同网络配置中striatum节点的状态分布。\",\n      \"population\": \"无患者样本；12节点FoG相关网络。\",\n      \"n_enrolled\": null,\n      \"n_analyzed\": null,\n      \"n_patients_with_FOG\": null,\n      \"n_patients_with_valid_neural_data\": null,\n      \"n_FOG_events\": null,\n      \"n_trials\": null,\n      \"n_electrodes_contacts\": null,\n      \"missing_reason\": \"不适用：分析对象是网络吸引子，而非患者或神经记录。\",\n      \"endpoint_class\": \"unclear\",\n      \"event_phase\": \"not_applicable\",\n      \"freezing_phenotype\": \"未报告具体FOG表型。\",\n      \"medication_phenotype\": \"unknown\",\n      \"experimental_medication_state\": \"不适用。\",\n      \"DBS_state_and_parameters\": \"比较healthy、PD、STN DBS及STN+SNr DBS四种网络配置。DBS通过删除相应节点的所有输出连接模拟。\",\n      \"task\": \"SER网络动力学分析。\",\n      \"recording_location\": \"无神经记录；分析striatum网络节点的S状态。\",\n      \"measure\": \"在全部period-3 limit cycles中，striatum始终处于susceptible（S）状态的limit cycles所占比例。\",\n      \"frequency_and_analysis_window\": \"离散时间SER模型；基于period-3 limit cycles统计，不涉及神经振荡频带。\",\n      \"finding\": \"healthy配置中42%的limit cycles具有striatum始终处于S状态的特征；PD配置中该比例下降至4%；STN DBS和STN+SNr DBS配置中均回升至17%。\",\n      \"effect_estimate\": \"Healthy=42%；PD=4%；STN DBS=17%；STN+SNr DBS=17%。分母是各网络配置的period-3 limit cycles，而非全部初始状态或患者数。\",\n      \"statistical_unit_and_method\": \"网络吸引子级描述性统计；统计不同配置中striatum始终为S状态的limit cycles比例。无患者级统计。\",\n      \"risk_of_bias\": {\n        \"tool_or_framework\": \"adapted_not_validated：计算模型研究评价框架。\",\n        \"domains\": [\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"模型构念效度\",\n            \"judgement\": \"high\",\n            \"reason\": \"S状态属于SER模型定义的susceptible状态，不能直接等同于人体纹状体神经元静息或临床神经放电频率。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Materials and methods，pp.14-15\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"DBS干预操作化\",\n            \"judgement\": \"high\",\n            \"reason\": \"DBS通过删除网络输出边实现，而非真实电刺激。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Materials and methods，pp.13-14\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"参数敏感性\",\n            \"judgement\": \"unclear\",\n            \"reason\": \"未报告不同模型参数下该比例是否稳定。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Results，p.7\"\n          }\n        ],\n        \"overall\": \"high\"\n      },\n      \"limitations\": \"这是striatum节点的模型状态比例，不是STN神经活动，也不是实际纹状体放电率。作者在Discussion中另行讨论了既往人类纹状体记录，但该记录并非本研究新采集的数据。\",\n      \"quote\": \"the striatum is always in a susceptible state S\",\n      \"source_locator\": {\n        \"section\": \"Results: Emerging dynamical patterns\",\n        \"page\": \"7/20\",\n        \"figure_table\": \"Table 1及其后续文字分析\",\n        \"supplement\": null\n      },\n      \"basis\": \"fulltext\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"eid_local\": \"POP2023_E08\",\n      \"design\": \"原始计算建模研究；基于SER状态时间序列构建网络coactivation matrices。\",\n      \"population\": \"无患者样本；12节点FoG相关网络。\",\n      \"n_enrolled\": null,\n      \"n_analyzed\": null,\n      \"n_patients_with_FOG\": null,\n      \"n_patients_with_valid_neural_data\": null,\n      \"n_FOG_events\": null,\n      \"n_trials\": null,\n      \"n_electrodes_contacts\": null,\n      \"missing_reason\": \"不适用：网络模拟研究，无患者、电极或临床事件。\",\n      \"endpoint_class\": \"unclear\",\n      \"event_phase\": \"not_applicable\",\n      \"freezing_phenotype\": \"未报告具体FOG表型。\",\n      \"medication_phenotype\": \"unknown\",\n      \"experimental_medication_state\": \"不适用。\",\n      \"DBS_state_and_parameters\": \"比较healthy与PD网络配置；不涉及实际电刺激。\",\n      \"task\": \"SER网络状态时间序列及节点共激活分析。\",\n      \"recording_location\": \"无实际神经记录；网络节点包括STN、SNr、脑干及皮层等区域。\",\n      \"measure\": \"Coactivation matrix：根据网络状态时间序列中同时出现的excited（E）状态计算节点间共激活强度。\",\n      \"frequency_and_analysis_window\": \"根据SER模型时间序列累计同时出现的E状态；无LFP频段、功率谱或临床事件分析窗口。\",\n      \"finding\": \"healthy网络coactivation matrix呈较平滑的模式，而PD网络呈较明显的checkerboard模式。作者将其解释为PD网络共激活模式发生改变，并与网络碎片化结果相联系。\",\n      \"effect_estimate\": \"定性差异：healthy=smooth pattern；PD=checkerboard pattern。没有报告患者级效应量、置信区间或P值。\",\n      \"statistical_unit_and_method\": \"网络配置级coactivation matrix；根据SER时间序列中同时发生的E状态计算共激活矩阵。非患者级统计。\",\n      \"risk_of_bias\": {\n        \"tool_or_framework\": \"adapted_not_validated：计算模型研究评价框架。\",\n        \"domains\": [\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"信号构念效度\",\n            \"judgement\": \"high\",\n            \"reason\": \"coactivation来自SER模型状态，不是实际STN-LFP、皮层-STN coherence或单单位记录。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Materials and methods，p.15\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"网络拓扑设定\",\n            \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\",\n            \"reason\": \"共激活模式取决于预设网络连接及二值权重。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Materials and methods，pp.13-15\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"外部验证\",\n            \"judgement\": \"high\",\n            \"reason\": \"没有用实际患者神经记录验证checkerboard模式。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Results，pp.9-10\"\n          }\n        ],\n        \"overall\": \"high\"\n      },\n      \"limitations\": \"Coactivation matrix不能等同于神经振荡功率、beta burst、相位同步或皮层-STN coherence。本文没有实际记录STN神经信号。\",\n      \"quote\": \"The pattern of activity in the healthy matrix appears to be smooth, whereas the pattern is more checkerboard in the PD coactivation matrix.\",\n      \"source_locator\": {\n        \"section\": \"Results: Coactivation matrices\",\n        \"page\": \"9-10/20\",\n        \"figure_table\": \"Fig. 7A-B\",\n        \"supplement\": null\n      },\n      \"basis\": \"fulltext\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"eid_local\": \"POP2023_E09\",\n      \"design\": \"原始计算建模研究；比较不同DBS网络配置的coactivation matrix与healthy网络之间的距离。\",\n      \"population\": \"无患者样本；12节点FoG相关网络。\",\n      \"n_enrolled\": null,\n      \"n_analyzed\": null,\n      \"n_patients_with_FOG\": null,\n      \"n_patients_with_valid_neural_data\": null,\n      \"n_FOG_events\": null,\n      \"n_trials\": null,\n      \"n_electrodes_contacts\": null,\n      \"missing_reason\": \"不适用：无患者或真实神经记录。\",\n      \"endpoint_class\": \"unclear\",\n      \"event_phase\": \"not_applicable\",\n      \"freezing_phenotype\": \"未报告。\",\n      \"medication_phenotype\": \"unknown\",\n      \"experimental_medication_state\": \"不适用。\",\n      \"DBS_state_and_parameters\": \"比较PD、STN DBS和STN+SNr DBS模型。STN DBS通过删除STN输出连接模拟；STN+SNr DBS通过同时删除STN和SNr输出连接模拟。\",\n      \"task\": \"SER模型coactivation matrix比较。\",\n      \"recording_location\": \"无实际神经记录；STN与SNr是模型节点。\",\n      \"measure\": \"不同网络配置coactivation matrices之间的1-norm distance，以healthy配置为参照。\",\n      \"frequency_and_analysis_window\": \"SER模型状态序列计算coactivation matrix；无电生理频率或LFP分析窗口。\",\n      \"finding\": \"STN+SNr DBS的coactivation matrix相较PD配置更接近healthy配置；单独STN DBS没有表现出相同的接近healthy状态的结果。\",\n      \"effect_estimate\": \"方向性结果：STN+SNr DBS的1-norm distance相对PD更接近healthy；STN DBS未显示同样趋势。Fig. 7E提供图形结果，正文未给出可直接核查的精确数值。\",\n      \"statistical_unit_and_method\": \"网络配置级矩阵比较；使用1-norm distance衡量coactivation matrix之间的差异。无患者级统计、P值或置信区间。\",\n      \"risk_of_bias\": {\n        \"tool_or_framework\": \"adapted_not_validated：计算模型研究评价框架。\",\n        \"domains\": [\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"DBS干预构念效度\",\n            \"judgement\": \"high\",\n            \"reason\": \"两种刺激模式均被模拟为网络输出连接删除，未模拟实际电刺激的电场或频率依赖效应。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Materials and methods，pp.13-14\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"模型信号效度\",\n            \"judgement\": \"high\",\n            \"reason\": \"coactivation矩阵来自SER状态，而非患者神经记录。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Materials and methods，p.15\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"参数稳健性\",\n            \"judgement\": \"unclear\",\n            \"reason\": \"未报告改变网络权重或刺激模型假设后的1-norm距离稳健性。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Results，p.10；Materials and methods，pp.13-15\"\n          }\n        ],\n        \"overall\": \"high\"\n      },\n      \"limitations\": \"该结果支持模型内联合刺激对网络共激活模式的影响，但不能证明患者接受联合DBS后STN神经活动更接近健康状态。尤其不能将矩阵相似性解释为beta功率正常化。\",\n      \"quote\": \"the STN+SNr DBS coactivation matrix is more similar to the healthy state coactivation matrix relative to the PD configuration.\",\n      \"source_locator\": {\n        \"section\": \"Results: Coactivation matrices\",\n        \"page\": \"9-10/20\",\n        \"figure_table\": \"Fig. 7C-E\",\n        \"supplement\": null\n      },\n      \"basis\": \"fulltext\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"eid_local\": \"POP2023_E10\",\n      \"design\": \"原始计算建模研究；比较PD、STN DBS和STN+SNr DBS配置下的网络活动传播。\",\n      \"population\": \"无患者样本；12节点FoG相关网络。\",\n      \"n_enrolled\": null,\n      \"n_analyzed\": null,\n      \"n_patients_with_FOG\": null,\n      \"n_patients_with_valid_neural_data\": null,\n      \"n_FOG_events\": null,\n      \"n_trials\": null,\n      \"n_electrodes_contacts\": null,\n      \"missing_reason\": \"不适用：纯网络模拟，无患者、电极或临床试次。\",\n      \"endpoint_class\": \"unclear\",\n      \"event_phase\": \"not_applicable\",\n      \"freezing_phenotype\": \"未报告具体FOG表型。\",\n      \"medication_phenotype\": \"unknown\",\n      \"experimental_medication_state\": \"不适用。\",\n      \"DBS_state_and_parameters\": \"PD、STN DBS和STN+SNr DBS模型比较；两种DBS均以删除刺激目标节点输出连接模拟。\",\n      \"task\": \"SER网络活动传播分析，无实际步行任务。\",\n      \"recording_location\": \"无实际神经记录；涉及基底节、脑干和皮层网络节点。\",\n      \"measure\": \"Spike propagation flow normalization：比较不同网络连接投射的活动传播矩阵与healthy状态的距离。\",\n      \"frequency_and_analysis_window\": \"兴奋性投射采用目标区域信号相对源区域信号向后移动一个离散时间步的shifted coactivation matrix；抑制性投射使用未移位的coactivation matrix，并排除transient time。采用1-norm distance。无振荡频段。\",\n      \"finding\": \"作者报告两种DBS配置总体上均表现出活动传播流的正常化，Fig. 8中两种DBS配置均出现更多代表接近healthy状态的颜色编码投射。\",\n      \"effect_estimate\": \"定性结果：STN DBS与STN+SNr DBS均在总体网络投射活动传播方面表现出正常化趋势。没有报告总体归一化的精确效应量、置信区间或P值。\",\n      \"statistical_unit_and_method\": \"网络投射对级分析；根据不同投射的coactivation matrix计算1-norm distance，并与healthy和PD配置比较。\",\n      \"risk_of_bias\": {\n        \"tool_or_framework\": \"adapted_not_validated：计算模型研究评价框架。\",\n        \"domains\": [\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"模型构念效度\",\n            \"judgement\": \"high\",\n            \"reason\": \"spike propagation flow为SER模型中的离散状态传播，不是实际记录的神经元动作电位传播。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Materials and methods，pp.14-15\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"DBS干预操作化\",\n            \"judgement\": \"high\",\n            \"reason\": \"DBS模拟为删除节点输出边，不能反映实际电刺激的生理效应。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Materials and methods，pp.13-14\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"外部验证\",\n            \"judgement\": \"high\",\n            \"reason\": \"没有实际STN或脑干神经活动记录验证传播流变化。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Results，pp.10-11\"\n          }\n        ],\n        \"overall\": \"high\"\n      },\n      \"limitations\": \"该结果是模型层面的网络活动传播正常化，不是实测神经放电流、STN-LFP或皮层-STN耦合变化。作者没有提供真实FOG事件前、中、后的时间锁定分析。\",\n      \"quote\": \"Fig. 8 shows a general normalization of the spike flow during both of the DBS configurations\",\n      \"source_locator\": {\n        \"section\": \"Results: Activity propagation\",\n        \"page\": \"10/20\",\n        \"figure_table\": \"Fig. 8\",\n        \"supplement\": null\n      },\n      \"basis\": \"fulltext\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"eid_local\": \"POP2023_E11\",\n      \"design\": \"原始计算建模研究；比较STN DBS与STN+SNr DBS在脑干相关投射上的活动传播正常化。\",\n      \"population\": \"无患者样本；12节点FoG相关网络，包括LC、PRF、PPN及其他脑区。\",\n      \"n_enrolled\": null,\n      \"n_analyzed\": null,\n      \"n_patients_with_FOG\": null,\n      \"n_patients_with_valid_neural_data\": null,\n      \"n_FOG_events\": null,\n      \"n_trials\": null,\n      \"n_electrodes_contacts\": null,\n      \"missing_reason\": \"不适用：计算模型，无人体或动物神经记录。\",\n      \"endpoint_class\": \"unclear\",\n      \"event_phase\": \"not_applicable\",\n      \"freezing_phenotype\": \"未报告。\",\n      \"medication_phenotype\": \"unknown\",\n      \"experimental_medication_state\": \"不适用。\",\n      \"DBS_state_and_parameters\": \"比较STN DBS与STN+SNr DBS模型。两种刺激分别通过删除STN输出连接及STN、SNr共同输出连接实现。\",\n      \"task\": \"网络投射活动传播模拟。\",\n      \"recording_location\": \"无实际神经记录；重点分析LC、PRF、PPN及皮层相关网络投射。\",\n      \"measure\": \"特定脑干及皮层相关投射的activity propagation flow与healthy状态的距离。\",\n      \"frequency_and_analysis_window\": \"兴奋性投射使用shifted coactivation matrix；1-norm distance；离散时间SER模型，无LFP频段。\",\n      \"finding\": \"STN+SNr DBS在以下四条投射的兴奋性活动传播正常化方面表现出STN DBS未达到的优势：LC-PRF、PRF-LC、PRF-PPN及LC-Ctx。\",\n      \"effect_estimate\": \"四条投射：LC→PRF、PRF→LC、PRF→PPN、LC→Ctx。作者报告STN+SNr DBS在这些投射上更接近healthy状态。正文未报告精确距离或置信区间。\",\n      \"statistical_unit_and_method\": \"网络投射级比较；对每条投射的活动传播矩阵计算1-norm distance，以healthy状态为参照。\",\n      \"risk_of_bias\": {\n        \"tool_or_framework\": \"adapted_not_validated：计算模型研究评价框架。\",\n        \"domains\": [\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"DBS干预构念效度\",\n            \"judgement\": \"high\",\n            \"reason\": \"联合刺激通过删除STN及SNr输出连接实现，并非真实联合电刺激。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Materials and methods，pp.13-14\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"模型拓扑和投射设定\",\n            \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\",\n            \"reason\": \"投射及方向由预先指定的FoG网络结构决定，结果依赖初始拓扑。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Materials and methods，pp.13-14\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"生理及临床外部验证\",\n            \"judgement\": \"high\",\n            \"reason\": \"没有直接测量脑干投射活动，也没有用实际FOG事件验证这四条投射的作用。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Results，pp.10-11；Discussion，p.11\"\n          }\n        ],\n        \"overall\": \"high\"\n      },\n      \"limitations\": \"该结果是本文最明确的联合STN+SNr相对单独STN DBS的投射级模型差异。它支持作者提出的脑干活动传播正常化机制，但没有提供患者级验证，也没有测量FOG发生前后的投射活动。LC、PRF、PPN的网络投射不能等同于实测神经信号。\",\n      \"quote\": \"STN+SNr DBS is exclusively effective (purple squares for the LC-PRF, PRF-LC, PRF-PPN, LC-Ctx projections).\",\n      \"source_locator\": {\n        \"section\": \"Results: Activity propagation\",\n        \"page\": \"10/20\",\n        \"figure_table\": \"Fig. 8\",\n        \"supplement\": null\n      },\n      \"basis\": \"fulltext\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"eid_local\": \"POP2023_E12\",\n      \"design\": \"原始计算建模研究；分析STN DBS相对于STN+SNr DBS的特定投射活动传播。\",\n      \"population\": \"无患者样本；12节点FoG相关网络。\",\n      \"n_enrolled\": null,\n      \"n_analyzed\": null,\n      \"n_patients_with_FOG\": null,\n      \"n_patients_with_valid_neural_data\": null,\n      \"n_FOG_events\": null,\n      \"n_trials\": null,\n      \"n_electrodes_contacts\": null,\n      \"missing_reason\": \"不适用：网络计算模型，没有患者或真实神经记录。\",\n      \"endpoint_class\": \"unclear\",\n      \"event_phase\": \"not_applicable\",\n      \"freezing_phenotype\": \"未报告。\",\n      \"medication_phenotype\": \"unknown\",\n      \"experimental_medication_state\": \"不适用。\",\n      \"DBS_state_and_parameters\": \"STN DBS与STN+SNr DBS虚拟断连模型比较；无实际刺激参数。\",\n      \"task\": \"网络投射活动传播分析。\",\n      \"recording_location\": \"无实际神经记录；模型网络中的各脑区节点。\",\n      \"measure\": \"不同网络投射的activity propagation flow与healthy状态的距离。\",\n      \"frequency_and_analysis_window\": \"SER模型离散时间序列；使用投射coactivation matrix和1-norm distance；无频段。\",\n      \"finding\": \"作者指出，单独STN DBS在一些特定投射上比STN+SNr DBS更接近healthy状态。这些投射在Fig. 8中以黄色方格标记，但正文没有逐一列出其具体投射名称。作者认为这些投射可能是联合刺激配置需要关注的节点或连接。\",\n      \"effect_estimate\": \"定性方向：存在STN DBS更接近healthy状态的特定投射；具体投射名称及精确距离未在正文中逐项报告。\",\n      \"statistical_unit_and_method\": \"网络投射级描述性比较；根据1-norm distance将各投射分类为更接近healthy或PD状态。\",\n      \"risk_of_bias\": {\n        \"tool_or_framework\": \"adapted_not_validated：计算模型研究评价框架。\",\n        \"domains\": [\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"模型构念效度\",\n            \"judgement\": \"high\",\n            \"reason\": \"模型投射活动不能直接等同于患者神经放电或功能连接。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Materials and methods，pp.14-15\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"结果可核查性\",\n            \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\",\n            \"reason\": \"正文只报告STN DBS在specific projections上更有利，没有在正文逐一列出对应投射名称；具体信息依赖Fig. 8颜色编码。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Results，p.10；Fig. 8\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"外部验证\",\n            \"judgement\": \"high\",\n            \"reason\": \"没有实际患者记录验证这些STN DBS优势投射。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Discussion，pp.10-12\"\n          }\n        ],\n        \"overall\": \"high\"\n      },\n      \"limitations\": \"不能根据正文将黄色方格未明确命名的投射自行补全。该结果也不能证明单独STN DBS在临床FOG方面优于联合刺激；它只描述模型中的投射级活动传播差异。\",\n      \"quote\": \"STN DBS is more beneficial for specific projections (yellow squares)\",\n      \"source_locator\": {\n        \"section\": \"Results: Activity propagation\",\n        \"page\": \"10/20\",\n        \"figure_table\": \"Fig. 8\",\n        \"supplement\": null\n      },\n      \"basis\": \"fulltext\"\n    }\n  ]\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "c9108809-a029-4f4f-bfad-453f509935ff", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261113T105805125809Z", "elapsed_seconds": 279.062, "completed_utc": "2026-11-13T11:02:44.192760+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "26dc69bc9594782bde97c6a91077ed3a0a11af9bda236e0383f68541d9a92b6f", "attachment_count": 1}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 1, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261113T105805125809Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-offline.png": "10fedc20bf32a841f2c8129a2f96bad672009e04585d7cd4ad715174d0e97ed0"}}}
